WEBVTT

00:03:29.460 --> 00:03:32.173
Human mind is like water.

00:03:33.160 --> 00:03:36.180
If it gets affected
by external conditions,

00:03:36.210 --> 00:03:37.700
it creates movement

00:03:37.720 --> 00:03:39.940
and you cannot see the depth.

00:03:39.970 --> 00:03:42.473
This magical mantra, "thank you,"

00:03:43.250 --> 00:03:46.020
and the true feeling
of gratitude in your heart

00:03:46.640 --> 00:03:53.510
can help you deal with any life situation
peacefully, joyfully and blissfully.

00:03:54.300 --> 00:03:59.050
May all beings be well, happy,
free from all suffering

00:03:59.080 --> 00:04:00.273
and be enlightened.